[2026-03-15T00:09:07.705Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014qPfjViBU5gVJM1ZhGgKgX","type":"tool_result","content":"195:- **Initial state:** User is on the home page. A property exists with title \"Cozy Cabin\", city \"Aspen\", country \"US\", property_type \"Cabin\", price_per_night 150, an average rating of 4.5, and 12 reviews.\n196:- **Expected:** The property card shows: the main property image at the top, a \"Cabin\" property type badge, the title \"Cozy Cabin\", location \"Aspen, US\", \"$150 / night\" price, and a star icon with \"4.5 (12 reviews)\" rating display.\n211:#### Test: Property card displays average rating with review count\n212:- **Initial state:** User is on the home page. A property has an average rating of 4.2 from 8 reviews.\n213:- **Expected:** The card shows a star icon with \"4.2\" and \"(8 reviews)\" or \"(8)\" next to it. If the property has no reviews, the rating section shows \"New\" or is not displayed.\n359:<!-- Components: ImageGallery, PropertyHeader, PropertyInfo, PropertyDescription, AmenitiesList, BookingCard, ReviewsSection, HostInfoCard -->\n392:- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id` for a property with title \"Luxury Villa in Bali\", city \"Ubud\", country \"Indonesia\", an average rating of 4.7 from 23 reviews, hosted by \"Jane Host\" with an avatar.\n393:- **Expected:** The property header shows the title \"Luxury Villa in Bali\", location \"Ubud, Indonesia\", a star icon with \"4.7\" and \"(23 reviews)\", and the host name \"Jane Host\" with their avatar image.\n395:#### Test: Property header shows \"New\" when property has no reviews\n396:- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page for a property with no reviews.\n397:- **Expected:** The rating summary area shows \"New\" or no rating display instead of a numeric rating and review count.\n399:#### Test: Clicking review count scrolls to or navigates to reviews section\n400:- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page with reviews.\n401:- **Action:** User clicks the \"(23 reviews)\" link in the property header.\n402:- **Expected:** The page scrolls down to the ReviewsSection on the same page.\n540:- **Expected:** The booking card remains visible in a sticky sidebar position as the user scrolls through the property description, amenities, and reviews.\n547:### Component: ReviewsSection\n549:#### Test: Reviews section displays average ratings by category\n550:- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id` for a property with multiple reviews. The average ratings are: cleanliness 4.5, accuracy 4.2, communication 4.8, location 4.6, value 4.0.\n551:- **Expected:** The reviews section shows a summary with average ratings for each category: \"Cleanliness: 4.5\", \"Accuracy: 4.2\", \"Communication: 4.8\", \"Location: 4.6\", \"Value: 4.0\". Each rating is displayed with a star icon or progress bar. An overall average rating is also displayed.\n553:#### Test: Reviews section displays overall average rating and total review count\n554:- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page with 15 reviews and an overall average rating of 4.3.\n555:- **Expected:** The reviews section header shows a star icon with \"4.3\" and \"15 reviews\" (or similar format like \"4.3 · 15 reviews\").\n557:#### Test: Reviews section displays individual review cards\n558:- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page with reviews. A review exists from guest \"Alice\" dated \"2026-01-15\" with rating 5 and comment \"Amazing place, loved every minute!\".\n559:- **Expected:** An individual review card is displayed showing the guest name \"Alice\", the date \"January 2026\" (or similar formatted date), a star rating of 5, and the comment text \"Amazing place, loved every minute!\".\n561:#### Test: Review cards display guest avatar or initial\n562:- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page with reviews. A reviewer has an avatar_url set, another reviewer does not.\n563:- **Expected:** Review cards show the guest's avatar image when available. When no avatar is set, a placeholder (e.g., first initial in a circle) is displayed.\n565:#### Test: Reviews section shows message when property has no reviews","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01AkZ4makjUs3jazE7GzWQav","session_id":"ed4f3c62-e32b-47e8-ad73-d7f458349ef4","uuid":"aaef84f5-8a37-4137-b27a-32c11e5c60cf"}
