**Initial state:** User is logged in and navigates to `/trips/booking-789/review` for a completed booking.\n1314:- **Initial state:** User is logged in and navigates to `/trips/booking-789/review` for a completed booking.\n1329:- **Expected:** The review is submitted successfully via `POST /api/reviews`. The app navigates back to `/trips` (My Trips page). A success notification or message such as \"Review submitted successfully\" appears.\n1344:- **Expected:** The review is submitted successfully (comment is optional per the data model). The app navigates back to `/trips`.\n1357:- **Action:** User clicks \"Write Review\", fills out all ratings (all set to 4) and a comment \"Great stay!\", and clicks \"Submit Review\". User is redirected to `/trips`.\n1363:- **Expected:** The user is taken back to `/trips`. No review is submitted. The \"Write Review\" button still appears on the trip card.\n1372:- **Action:** User navigates to `/trips/booking-789/review` directly via URL.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01AkZ4makjUs3jazE7GzWQav","session_id":"ed4f3c62-e32b-47e8-ad73-d7f458349ef4","uuid":"b7a9f4fa-247c-4a5e-99db-4cc2c4d74124"}
