- **Special Requests**: Need parking info\n\n**Source File**: `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/scripts/seed-db.ts` (lines 290-300 for bookings data, lines 54-65 for user profile)"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: ac09e9c38d19872f3 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 29586\ntool_uses: 8\nduration_ms: 10107</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ed4f3c62-e32b-47e8-ad73-d7f458349ef4","uuid":"6b24f63b-9ce6-4293-bd35-f0389239f483","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In /repo/apps/AirbnbClone, find the seed data file(s) that define bookings/reservations. I need to know all bookings for emma@example.com and their check-in dates/statuses. Also find any booking with ID containing \"e7777\" or similar for Emma. Look in netlify/functions/, scripts/, or any seed-related files. Return the full booking records for Emma.","agentId":"ac09e9c38d19872f3","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I found the seed data file with all the booking information. Let me extract the booking records for Emma. Based on the seed-db.ts file, I can see that Emma Wilson has the user ID `a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333` with email `emma@example.com`.\n\nHere are all of Emma's bookings from the seed data:\n\n## Full Booking Records for Emma (emma@example.com)\n\nEmma Wilson (user ID: `a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333`) has **3 bookings** in the seed database:\n\n### Booking 1\n- **ID**: `e1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111`\n- **Property**: Cozy Downtown Loft with City Views (b1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111)\n- **Check-in**: 2025-12-15\n- **Check-out**: 2025-12-20\n- **Guests**: 2\n- **Total Price**: $825\n- **Status**: completed\n- **Special Requests**: Late check-in please\n\n### Booking 2\n- **ID**: `e3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333`\n- **Property**: Mountain Cabin Retreat (b3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333)\n- **Check-in**: 2026-05-10\n- **Check-out**: 2026-05-13\n- **Guests**: 2\n- **Total Price**: $650\n- **Status**: pending\n- **Special Requests**: Celebrating anniversary\n\n### Booking 3 (Contains \"e7777\" pattern match)\n- **ID**: `e7777777-7777-7777-7777-777777777777`\n- **Property**: Beachfront Villa with Private Pool (b2222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222)\n- **Check-in**: 2026-07-01\n- **Check-out**: 2026-07-05\n- **Guests**: 2\n- **Total Price**: $1900\n- **Status**: confirmed\n- **Special Requests**: None\n\nAdditionally, there is one more booking associated with Emma's ID:\n\n### Booking 4\n- **ID**: `e6666666-6666-6666-6666-666666666666`\n- **Property**: Historic Townhouse in Georgetown (b5555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555)\n- **Check-in**: 2026-06-15\n- **Check-out**: 2026-06-20\n- **Guests**: 4\n- **Total Price**: $1475\n- **Status**: confirmed\n- **Special Requests**: Need parking info\n\n**Source File**: `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/scripts/seed-db.ts` (lines 290-300 for bookings data, lines 54-65 for user profile)"}],"totalDurationMs":10107,"totalTokens":29586,"totalToolUseCount":8,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10554,"cache_read_input_tokens":18315,"output_tokens":710,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":10554},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
